  "title": "Restaurant-Style Zuppa Toscana",
  "description": "Restaurant-style soup. Crumbled bacon, Italian sausage, chopped kale, and cream are combined in this chicken stock based soup with potatoes.",
  "authors": [
    "Nancy"
  ],
